msgid "Skeletonizer"
msgstr "Skeletonizer"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4383
msgid "分岐点が低い高さか判定するしきい値"
msgstr "Threshold to determine if a branch point has low height"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4384
msgid "枝とみなす短い線を追跡する最大長"
msgstr "Maximum length to track short lines considered as branches"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4385
msgid "小さすぎる線分（ノイズ）を削除する面積しきい値"
msgstr "Area threshold to remove too-small line segments (noise)"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4386
msgid "骨格上の小ループ（マスクの穴由来の二重線）を1本に潰す最大囲み面積。0で無効"
msgstr ""
"Maximum enclosed area of small skeleton loops (double lines around mask "
"holes) collapsed into a single line. 0 disables"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4387
msgid "高さに関係なく除去する行き止まりの短い枝の最大長。画素単位のため解像度に応じて調整。0で無効"
msgstr ""
"Maximum length of dead-end spurs removed regardless of height. Pixel-"
"based, so adjust for the scan resolution. 0 disables"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4389
msgid "Kinkdetector"
msgstr "Kinkdetector"

#: guis/GUI01_Image_Preprocessor.py:4390
